{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑↑この部分あみの好きなとこ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/smile.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、申し遅れましたすっぴんで失礼しますﾋﾟﾖ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/19/120219_234003.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきね～温泉いってきたよ？\nめっさ気持ち良かった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カカオチョコレート風呂っていいのがあってね、\n入ってきた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘い甘い香りに包まれて、\n幸せな気分になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげでお肌つるっつるてんてんとてんになったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばこの間すごく嬉しかった事があったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達とお買い物に行ったらさ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『♪♪♪♪カーテンの中～太陽と彼女と私～♪♪』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"……ｷﾀーーーーーー！！！！！！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店内に大音量で流れた時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に嬉しくて\n思わず「はい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私この歌歌ってますはい私"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」\nって言いたくなってしまったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/bleah.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからたくさん流れるといいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}